{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/Cirque-Description-Header.png?t=1747071180\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Show. Try Not to Die.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cirque de Slay</i> is a turn-based multiplayer horror roguelike set in a cursed carnival, where light is a commodity and your friends are never truly on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each round, players take turns exploring this twisted circus, looting gear, avoiding traps, and racing to find the boss. But while one player explores, the others spectate... and interfere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spectators play sinister cards that alter the active player\u2019s run in real time, spawning enemies, closing doors, flipping traps, or stealing their loot. No run is ever safe\u2026 and no victory is ever guaranteed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/Cirque-Description-Section-Header.png?t=1747071180\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/Cirque_De_Slay_Combat.gif?t=1747071180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-taking Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Up to four players alternate daring runs through blood-soaked floors and nightmarish attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/Cirque_de_Slay_Spectator.gif?t=1747071180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spectator Sabotage</strong> \u2013 Influence the game even when you're not playing with a deck of chaos-inducing cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/Cirque_de_Slay_Blood_Room.gif?t=1747071180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Procedural Carnival</strong> \u2013 Explore ever-changing, trap-filled arenas inspired by grotesque circus attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/Cirque_De_Slay_Loot.gif?t=1747071180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot, Upgrade, Survive</strong> \u2013 Scavenge powerful gear, manage your stamina, and prepare for a climactic boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/extras/Cirque_de_Slay_Announcement_Escape.gif?t=1747071180\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Only One Can Win</strong> \u2013 The first player to defeat the boss takes all. Everyone else gets... the curtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you make it out alive... or become part of the show?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595740?t=1747071180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595740?t=1747071180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/1d12a4e33a9c596f96c0bf75d658e90c6e2e4e23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747071180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595740/1d12a4e33a9c596f96c0bf75d658e90c6e2e4e23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747071180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Thi